    text: ...
  - startTime: 2.12
    endTime: 4.8506665
    text: ' Are you playing games with me?'
  - startTime: 6.194666
    endTime: 8.326667
    text: ' Every gesture like that'
  - startTime: 8.326667
    endTime: 11.057334
    text: brings you closer to expulsion.
  - startTime: 12.380667
    endTime: 13.618
    text: ' Pick it up!'
  - startTime: 14.812667
    endTime: 17.799334
    text: And put it back where it belongs.
